  {
   "ply": 5,
   "t": 90,
   "fen": "r1bqkbnr/pp1ppppp/2n5/2p5/3PP3/2P5/PP3PPP/RNBQKBNR b KQkq - 0 3",
   "line": [
    "d4"
   ],
   "spoken": "The pawn to c3 prepared this: the pawn to d4, building the classical centre. And in these lines the knight already on c6 is often misplaced, because White will recapture on d4 with a pawn and get a mobile centre the knight can't easily blockade.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": "c3 exists to support d4 — and an early Nc6 can misplace itself against the resulting pawn centre.",
   "plans": "Take the centre and use its mobility."
  },
  {
   "ply": 6,
   "t": 97,
   "fen": "r1bqkbnr/pp1ppppp/2n5/8/3pP3/2P5/PP3PPP/RNBQKBNR w KQkq - 0 4",
   "line": [
    "cxd4"
   ],
   "spoken": ""
  },
  {
   "ply": 7,
   "t": 101.5,
   "fen": "r1bqkbnr/pp1ppppp/2n5/8/3PP3/8/PP3PPP/RNBQKBNR b KQkq - 0 4",
   "line": [
    "cxd4"
   ],
   "spoken": ""
  },
  {
   "ply": 8,
   "t": 253,
   "fen": "r1bqkbnr/pp2pppp/2n5/3p4/3PP3/8/PP3PPP/RNBQKBNR w KQkq - 0 5",
   "line": [
    "d5"
   ],
   "spoken": "When Black strikes with d5, take it with the pawn — do NOT push e5. Locking the centre with e5 would concede an inferior French where Black's light-squared bishop has already escaped outside the chain.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": "Capture on d5 rather than closing with e5 — a French where the bad bishop is already free is a poor version.",
   "plans": "Open the centre and play against the isolani."
  },
  {
   "ply": 9,
   "t": 297,
   "fen": "r1bqkbnr/pp2pppp/2n5/3P4/3P4/8/PP3PPP/RNBQKBNR b KQkq - 0 5",
   "line": [
    "exd5"
   ],
   "spoken": ""
  },
  {
   "ply": 10,
   "t": 300.5,
   "fen": "r1b1kbnr/pp2pppp/2n5/3q4/3P4/8/PP3PPP/RNBQKBNR w KQkq - 0 6",
   "line": [
    "Qxd5"
   ],
   "spoken": "After the queen recaptures on d5, the position is the standard Alapin tabiya — reached here by the Nc6 move order, but the same familiar isolated-pawn battleground.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": "Recognise the transposition into the main isolated-pawn structure regardless of move order.",
   "plans": "Blockade d5, trade pieces, target the isolani."
  },
